{"hymn":"S861","parent":"E1025","quality":"adapted","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":8},"title":"¡Del mundo huid! ¡A Cristo ganad","subtitle":"El evangelio—Necesidad de Cristo","syl":{"n1":"¡Del","n2":["mun","i"],"n3":["do‿huid!","t"],"n4":"¡A","n5":["Cris","i"],"n6":["to","t"],"n7":["ga","i"],"n8":["nad!","t"],"n9":["Pue","i"],"n10":["de‿sa","m"],"n11":["ciar","t"],"n12":"hoy","n13":["tu‿co","i"],"n15":["ra","m"],"n16":["zón;","t"],"n17":"¿Qué","n18":"más","n19":["qui","i"],"n20":["sie","m"],"n21":["ras","t"],"n22":["tú‿en","i"],"n24":["con","m"],"n25":["trar?","t"],"n26":["¡To","i"],"n27":["das","t"],"n28":["las‿co","i"],"n29":["sas","t"],"n30":["va","i"],"n32":["cí‿as","t"],"n33":"son!","n34":"Él","n35":"es","n36":"tan","n37":["ri","i"],"n38":["co‿en","t"],"n39":["Su‿ple","i"],"n40":["ni","m"],"n41":["tud,","t"],"n42":["Pue","i"],"n43":["de‿col","m"],"n44":["mar‿tu","t"],"n45":["ne","i"],"n46":["ce","m"],"n48":["si","m"],"n49":["dad!","t"],"n50":"Él","n51":"es","n52":"tan","n53":["bue","i"],"n54":["no,","t"],"n55":"¡cuán","n56":"dul‿ce‿es","n57":"Él!","n58":["¡To","i"],"n59":["do","t"],"n60":["de","i"],"n61":["seo‿Él","t"],"n62":["sa","i"],"n64":["cia","m"],"n65":["rá!","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["¡Del mundo huid! ¡A Cristo ganad!","Él es tu grande necesidad.","Al recibir a Cristo el Señor,","Ya nada más tú desearás."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Aunque muy grande el mundo es,","Y muy pequeño tu corazón,","Pero el gran mundo con su caudal","No puede darte satisfacción."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Con este Cristo, gran gozo habrá;","Sin este Cristo, sólo pesar;","Donde está Cristo, hay claridad,","Donde Él no está, sólo oscuridad."]}]}